      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "The primary outcomes of this systematic review are first pass ETI and overall ETI success. Secondary outcomes include time to ETI, ease-of-use and ETI complications such as oesophageal intubation.",
      "reason": "The review defines the primary and secondary outcomes (which constitute the 'O' in PICO) and the intervention/comparison (bougies and stylets vs non-bougie/non-stylet methods) is described throughout the text, including in the aim statement in chunk text_4."
    }
