      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Studies were included if they met the following criteria: (1) clinical trials and observational studies that examine the use of laryngoscopes with tracheal tube introducers and/",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies study designs (clinical trials and observational studies) and the intervention (laryngoscopes with tracheal tube introducers), but the text is truncated and does not provide a comprehensive list of all eligibility criteria, such as specific population or comparator details."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
